            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "95ch",
            "richtext": "<h4>Meeting International Standards</h4><p>Our goal is to have all our filter media to align with global regulatory and consumer trends, broadly encompassed by UN Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) guidelines. Using EcoStatic in our filters will firmly put us on a pathway to achieving our goal.</p><p>More than 20 years ago, our Swedish founder Bengt Rittri had a vision of bringing clean, fresh Swedish air inside the home for his children and set out to make the best air purifier for the world to breathe fresher air. Today, we continue to commit to clean air while we work towards sustainable innovation to air purification.</p>",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
